R1\ cart\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ order,\ because\ cart\ and\ order\ are\ separate\ services;\ they\ talk\ only\ through\ shared\ events\ and\ ports\ (ARCH-1\ rule\ 1)=6a88640e-eda9-4033-9716-60c6ffb072d8
R1\ order\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ cart,\ because\ cart\ and\ order\ are\ separate\ services;\ they\ talk\ only\ through\ shared\ events\ and\ ports\ (ARCH-1\ rule\ 1)=f1ab5b7c-8b54-4a44-80fb-8c6b98361d8e
R2\ cart\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ other\ bounded\ contexts,\ except\ cart.out\ adapters\ calling\ their\ app\ facades,\ because\ contracts\ with\ other\ modules\ live\ in\ shared;\ an\ out\ adapter\ is\ the\ one\ swap\ point\ for\ a\ later\ HTTP\ or\ Kafka\ client\ (ARCH-1\ rule\ 1,\ ARCH-15)=5291fa81-019f-47ff-bad1-1b31271e85e8
R2\ order\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ other\ bounded\ contexts,\ except\ order.out\ adapters\ calling\ their\ app\ facades,\ because\ contracts\ with\ other\ modules\ live\ in\ shared;\ an\ out\ adapter\ is\ the\ one\ swap\ point\ for\ a\ later\ HTTP\ or\ Kafka\ client\ (ARCH-1\ rule\ 1,\ ARCH-15)=cc655f40-b2e3-4e6a-ae18-8e0c86d2c04c
R3\ classes\ outside\ cart\ and\ order\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ any\ cart\ or\ order\ class,\ because\ the\ only\ contract\ cart\ and\ order\ expose\ is\ the\ shared\ package\:\ events,\ ports,\ records\ (ARCH-1\ rules\ 1,\ 3,\ ARCH-15)=64a78c14-47cb-44e9-a5e3-a420e842c3b1
R4\ methods\ in\ cart\ and\ order\ must\ not\ be\ annotated\ with\ @EventListener\ (use\ @TransactionalEventListener\ AFTER_COMMIT),\ because\ cross-module\ writes\ happen\ only\ after\ commit;\ a\ same-transaction\ listener\ lets\ one\ module's\ rollback\ spread\ into\ another\ (ARCH-1\ rule\ 2)=e527755d-3f1f-4b74-908f-c06a3cd6c62b
R5\ cart\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ other\ modules'\ domain\ or\ out\ packages\ (entities,\ Q\ classes,\ repositories),\ because\ another\ module's\ tables\ belong\ to\ its\ own\ schema;\ joins,\ FKs\ and\ locks\ across\ schemas\ are\ not\ allowed\ (team\ decision\ 2026-11-04,\ ARCH-15)=d6b16aa5-b618-43e4-bfda-a4807ff56d89
R5\ order\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ other\ modules'\ domain\ or\ out\ packages\ (entities,\ Q\ classes,\ repositories),\ because\ another\ module's\ tables\ belong\ to\ its\ own\ schema;\ joins,\ FKs\ and\ locks\ across\ schemas\ are\ not\ allowed\ (team\ decision\ 2026-11-04,\ ARCH-15)=eb5780b2-b12c-4ab4-a40e-a5d642367d57
